From 4d3b30a637e521d9f2d3eb138c188005caa348ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 14:29:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): HeroUI-native restyle with large repo-grouped cards

Translate HeroUI v3 tokens into ArkUI (sky accent, 24vp cards, surface
shadow). Inbox defaults to full-width cards grouped by repository, with
richer status/preview/branch/PR chips. Shared HuButton/Chip/Field chrome
lands on detail, new-agent, settings, and composer.

Co-authored-by: treeatetree <37009839+treeatetree@users.noreply.github.com>
